            "review_title": "Review at Vuon Am Thuc Ran Rao",
            "review_text": "The Gypsy Club\nFloriana, Malta367 contributions\n1\nAwesome venue for trying your first snake!\nNov 2016 • Friends\nHad a snake lunch here with friends during our recent trip to Hanoi. It was totally worth it! The restaurant itself is set in a beautiful garden surrounding, and the owners make you feel very welcome indeed. The have a massive collection of snake wine to choose from, and are very happy to recommend certain dishes for first-timers. Takes around 20-30 minutes in a cab from Hanoi centre. Absolutely recommended!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 14, 2016",
            "rating": 4.0,
