            "review_title": "Review at Vuon Am Thuc Ran Rao",
            "review_text": "Benito63\nParis, France12 contributions\n1\nEat snake in Vietnam\nMay 2012 • Friends\nI had eat in Vuon Am Thuc Ran Rao at Le Mat village few weeks ago with my friends and our travel guide. I told him, I want to be surprised for lunch.\n\nDone! Eat snake it is a very intensive experience and there are a lot mean to cook snake dishes.\nBy the way the restaurant is very beautyfull, verdant and cozy. Perfect place to eat for romantic, friend or buisness meeting.\n\nI was very surprised and glad this experience with my friends, is why I recommande my travel agency.\n\nEnjoy your meal.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 7, 2012",
